{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It\u2019s 1968 in Vietnam, the time to \u201cMake War Not Love\u201d.</strong> Side with the Viet Cong or U.S. Army in this intense, fast-paced FPS set during the Vietnam War. Experience classic combat or jump into co-op zombie mode. Choose from 300+ weapons of destruction. <strong>Kill or be killed!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Various game modes<br>\u2022 20 historical battlefields<br>\u2022 Realistic player customization<br>\u2022 Over 300 weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rainbow Herbicides</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the horrors of deforestation chemicals like \u201cAgent Orange\u201d in co-op and single-player action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 6-player online co-op <br>\u2022 16 unique zombie types <br>\u2022 Construct barricades <br>\u2022 Deployable turrets <br>\u2022 Shop with 300+ weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NO MICROTRANSACTIONS. ALL FUTURE CONTENT IS FREE.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EARLY ACCESS \u2013 PERFORMANCE, GRAPHICS &amp; CONTENT ARE SUBJECT TO CHANGE.</h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ho Chi Minh Trail","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1012110/7f9156a776f4be89b82bcec776253d146a9eb0d1.jpg"},{"name":"Draft Notice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1012110/15cd63d0971b3e63699400f39a258110d54de78a.jpg"},{"name":"First Blood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1012110/6fc784401437a4717224481bad6e880aef8310f9.jpg"},{"name":"White Feather","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1012110/c98fdab2108cec45b5b20feb5075d6320ae0ed1